      "content": "The danger isn't just sudden fluctuation; the continuous, predictable interference from a high-potency supplement fundamentally changes how warfarin functions in your blood. You need a healthcare professional to manage this complex interaction, as a stable new INR could still be dangerously outside the therapeutic range for your condition. Please do not attempt to self-calibrate your treatment based on a theoretical equilibrium.",
      "source": "target",
